WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.334
Most forms lose nearly half their starters.

2
00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:06.327
Talkform lets people answer naturally, asks the useful follow-up,

3
00:00:06.478 --> 00:00:08.022
then returns structured data.

4
00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:12.365
Richer feedback. Smarter onboarding. Real personalization.

5
00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:14.559
Keep the schema. Lose the form.
